\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11630256\charrsid2708026  Which of the following statements is TRUE about the Classical and Keynesian approaches to achieve a macroeconomic equilibrium in an economy?
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11630256\charrsid2708026        }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid11630256\charrsid9649961 
